# unit benches: raspi 1024 items
 
  cargo dinghy -d laval bench --bench activations -- arm64simd_act_f32_32n/1024

* empty: ~2us
* noop100: 33us
* add100:  53us -> payload: 20us
* sub100:  54us -> payload: 20us
* mul100:  54us -> payload: 20us
* fma100:  77us

add100:
    1024 * 100 -> 100k ops -> 25k vops
    25k ops in 53us -> 471 MFLOP/s

    1 neon vector op / cycle
    1.4G neon vecto op / second
    1.4G * 4 = 5.6GFLOPS
